Source of the data
-------------------

The data in this package - show dates, venues, attendance, and setlists -
was originally sourced from the Fugazi Live Series website
(https://www.dischord.com/fugazi_live_series), which is copyright Dischord
Records.

Cleaning, corrections, venue geocoding, and re-organization of the raw data
into the tables included here are original work by the package maintainer,
Alex Mitrani.

License terms
--------------

Permission to redistribute Dischord Records' underlying show data openly
has been requested and is pending a reply. Until that permission is
confirmed, this package's copy of that data is provided for personal,
non-commercial, and research use only; it is not licensed for
redistribution.

Questions about reuse should be directed to the package maintainer (see
DESCRIPTION) and, for the underlying source data itself, to Dischord
Records.
